aving her father Belle  risked her life to find and save her dad  take me instead  whereas Mulan and Belle fled the safety  of their homes to save their fathers  Mawile last month newly to save her  people Moana was chosen to find Maui and  help him return to city's heart Moana  journeyed into the unknown to save the  entire world and she managed to find  herself in the process then there's  Tiana and Aurora who had to flee their  homes in hopes of breaking a curse  Tiana ran away from home after being  turned into a frog by Prince Naveen she  fled her hometown in search of a cure  and soon found herself going down the  Bayou Princess Aurora on the other hand  was forced to flee her castle in hopes  of escaping Maleficent wicked curse she  was raised in the forest by flora fauna  and Merryweather where she would  eventually meet her one true love  Aurora spent most of her life running  away from a curse and last but not least  it's clean Elsa who unlike the other  Disney Princesses has her own special  reason for running away from home Elsa  had no choice but to flee arendelle  after she exposed her powers  [Applause]  Elsa was unable to control her abilities  which put everyone at risk on top of  that she was tired of hiding who she  truly was and simply wanted to be  herself Merida also fell into this  category  but in the end Merida didn't need to run  away to be herself she'd always acted  herself to begin with Elsa on the other  hand never once told anyone about her  powers and forced herself into solitude  so there you have it guys the real  reason each Disney princess ran away  from home although every princess had  their reasons for fleeing they managed  to beat the odds and follow their hearts  in your opinion which Disney Princess  had the best reason for running away let  us know in the comments section below  and that's a wrap don't forget to  subscribe for more videos about your  favorite Disney Princesses and be sure  to give this video a big thumbs up